flowchart TB
    %% Client Layer
    Client["<b>Client Applications</b><br/><br/>Developers send AI inference requests<br/>using their own API keys (BYOK)"]

    %% Control Plane
    ControlPlane["<b>Schlep-Engine Control Plane</b><br/><br/>Intelligent routing and optimization layer<br/>• Health-aware provider selection<br/>• Automatic fallback & retry logic<br/>• Real-time performance monitoring<br/>• Cost and latency optimization"]

    %% Provider Network
    Providers["<b>AI Provider Network</b><br/><br/>Any connected model providers<br/>OpenAI-compatible APIs, custom endpoints,<br/>or verified partner integrations"]

    %% Request Flow
    Client -->|"1. Send Request"| ControlPlane
    ControlPlane -->|"2. Route to Best Provider"| Providers
    Providers -->|"3. Return Response"| ControlPlane
    ControlPlane -->|"4. Deliver Optimized Result"| Client

    %% Value Propositions (as notes)
    ValueProp1["✓ Single API for multiple providers<br/>✓ Zero vendor lock-in<br/>✓ Built-in reliability & failover"]
    ValueProp2["✓ Real-time provider health monitoring<br/>✓ Automatic cost optimization<br/>✓ Full observability & analytics"]

    %% Position value props
    Client ~~~ ValueProp1
    Providers ~~~ ValueProp2

    %% Styling - Plain and minimal
    style Client fill:#ffffff,stroke:#d0d0d0,stroke-width:2px,color:#1a1a1a
    style ControlPlane fill:#f8f9fa,stroke:#4a90e2,stroke-width:3px,color:#1a1a1a
    style Providers fill:#ffffff,stroke:#d0d0d0,stroke-width:2px,color:#1a1a1a

    style ValueProp1 fill:#f0f7ff,stroke:#e0e0e0,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray: 3 3,color:#333333
    style ValueProp2 fill:#f0f7ff,stroke:#e0e0e0,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray: 3 3,color:#333333
